    end

    subgraph Saída
        J[Veredito\nTRUE / FALSE / UNKNOWN]
        K[Witness\n(GraphML)]
        L[Teste\n(Concreto)]
    end

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G
    G --> H
    G --> I
    H --> J
    H --> K
    H --> L
    I --> J
```

